@page "/"
<PageTitle>AI StoryBuilders</PageTitle>

<div class="asb-home">
    <h1>AI StoryBuilders</h1>
    <p>
        This is the <b>AIStoryBuildersV2</b> scaffold — a .NET 11 MAUI Blazor Hybrid app (Windows) and a
        Blazor WebAssembly app sharing one Razor class library, mirroring the KnowledgeGraphBuilder structure.
    </p>

    <div class="asb-card">
        <b>Build this app from the design.</b>
        <p>
            The screens to implement are specified in <code>Docs/Design</code>. Open
            <code>Docs/Design/DESIGN.md</code> for the written spec and the interactive artboards
            (the <code>.dc.html</code> files) for the exact layouts and interactions.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p>Screens in the design:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Library</b> — home: top menu (Home · Logs · Utility · Settings), New / Import Story, story cards.</li>
        <li><b>Story Workspace</b> — tabs: Details, Timelines, Locations, Characters, Chapters, Chat, Knowledgebase.</li>
        <li><b>Manuscript Editor</b> — single page: auto-detected chapter/paragraph outline + paragraph tools.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
